units lj
atom_style bond
boundary s s s
lattice fcc 0.8
region box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box 2 box bond/types 1 extra/bond/per/atom 14
create_atoms 1 region box
mass * 1.0
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff * * 1.0 1.0
neighbor 0.3 bin
velocity all create 1.0 4928459 loop geom
displace_atoms all random 0.05 0.05 0.05 9827 units box
create_bonds many all all 1 0.0 1.3
bond_style harmonic
bond_coeff 1 100.0 1.2
fix nve all nve
timestep 0.001
compute bl all bond/local dist
fix sc all graphics/labels 1 colorscale viz "Bond Length" 60 20 0 size 28 length 300 horizontal tics 4 map bond
dump viz all image 1 img.*.ppm type type size 128 128 zoom 1.4 view 60 30 box no 0.02 adiam 0.5 bond c_bl 0.2 fix sc type 1 0
dump_modify viz pad 0 bmap min max cf 0.0 3 min blue 0.5 yellow max red
run 0
run 1
